 "bottom_line_note": "'no stratum' = gene not DepMap common-essential AND target expressed (log2TPM+1 >= 1) in that line AND the drug carries exactly one annotated target gene AND perturbation nz2 >= 100 AND drug nz2 >= 100. The two nz2 numbers are ILLUSTRATIVE and are adopted by nothing; S1 chooses floors. The mRNA-QC variant is reported for CRISPR as a SEPARATE line and is not applied, per D135-S0(8). Limitation 2 (non-catalytic scaffolding roles) is NOT COMPUTABLE - no curated list exists in the repo - so it is MISSING from every count here and the clean-positive numbers are therefore an UPPER bound.",
 "limitation_2_missing": "spec Section 6 limitation 2 (knockout removes scaffolding an inhibitor leaves intact) cannot be stratified: no curated list of targets with non-catalytic function is in the repo, and inventing one would be imputation. Reported missing, per D135-S0(9).",
